{"kind":"note","note_type":"basic","fields":["This duo achieved a number one hit in 1969 with a song that blatantly warned of the dangers of technology. The song had no chorus, and contained such upbeat lyrics as: Im kinda wonderin if man is gonna be alive. Hes taken everything this old Earth can give, and he aint put back nothing, whoa-whoa.","Zager Evans"],"tags_json":"[\"trivia\",\"music\",\"source:open-trivia-qa\",\"license:cc-by-sa-4.0\"]"}
